  "description": "All 19 I2I source tasks and the paired I2T-only baseline.",
  "notes": [
    "Stage1 is trained once per source with data/model42/4396; stage2 seeds42/43/44 all load those same raw weights.",
    "LLaVA baseline and source stage2 use identical data/model seed pairs.",
    "Prepare the seven released I2I pools and the fixed LLaVA pool with scripts/prepare_transfer.py. The twelve Taskonomy pools are restored from official sources using the published ID lists when their local manifests are missing.",
    "Transfer Colorization is Taskonomy grayscale-to-RGB; semantic segmentation targets resize with nearest interpolation.",
    "Jigsaw and Object pointing stage1 use16 per GPU; other stage1 and all I2T stages use4 per GPU with4 accumulation steps at four GPUs."
  ],
